{"schemaVersion":1,"id":398,"sections":[{"id":"917001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20675],"start":0,"count":29},{"id":"917001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20676],"start":29,"count":18}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:1","scriptId":20675,"text":"下午16：00，我们到达了一处中继站。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:2","scriptId":20675,"text":"此处离目标地点非常接近，于是我们打算在这里休整一下再开始搜寻任务。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:3","scriptId":20675,"text":"这个中继站不大，只能看到零散的几个士兵，但好像也有钢舞姬在驻守的样子。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:4","scriptId":20675,"text":"“地图上好像没有标识这个中继站么，难道是最近建立的？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:5","scriptId":20675,"text":"“啊，你好啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:6","scriptId":20675,"text":"看到个正在站岗的士兵，我便上去打了个招呼。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1139,"speaker":"特勤局军官？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:7","scriptId":20675,"text":"“…………”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:8","scriptId":20675,"text":"没想到被对方完全无视了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:9","scriptId":20675,"text":"考虑到自己这边的动作可能不够正式，于是我拿出了死水的证明——死水卡。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:10","scriptId":20675,"text":"“你好，我们是死水的队伍，可以借用一下这里是设施吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1139,"speaker":"特勤局军官？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:11","scriptId":20675,"text":"“…………”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:12","scriptId":20675,"text":"这次算是和对方对上了眼，不过依旧没有称之为对话的行为。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:13","scriptId":20675,"text":"（这家伙怎么回事？）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:14","scriptId":20675,"text":"在我开始揣测对方性格的时候，那名士兵终于开了口。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1139,"speaker":"特勤局军官？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:15","scriptId":20675,"text":"“可以。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:16","scriptId":20675,"text":"“非常感谢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:17","scriptId":20675,"text":"我也非常简短的回应了一下就匆匆返回队伍，毕竟这样尴尬的对话早点结束对双方都好。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":1139,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:19","scriptId":20675,"text":"“真是尴尬，没想到那个士兵那么冷淡。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:20","scriptId":20675,"text":"在我自言自语嘀咕着的时候佐伊她们也朝我这边走了过来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:21","scriptId":20675,"text":"“长官，搞定了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:22","scriptId":20675,"text":"“嗯，老样子，你们先开始补给好了，这个中继站比较小，我估计还是要在附近搭帐篷过夜。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:23","scriptId":20675,"text":"“诶……都到了中继站竟然还要睡地铺？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":579,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:24","scriptId":20675,"text":"“这个中继站的气氛有些怪怪的，平常我们去中继站好像都会有小哥迎上来，今天完全没有。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":579,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:25","scriptId":20675,"text":"以奈特莉的性格来说，这个中继站的风格确实有点让她不习惯。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":579,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:26","scriptId":20675,"text":"“或许只是这个站子的士兵比较正经吧，我刚才也是这情况，那些士兵一脸严肃有种不苟言笑的感觉。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":579,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":579,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:27","scriptId":20675,"text":"“是这样吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":579,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:28","scriptId":20675,"text":"正当大家要开始各干各的时候，佩妮叫道。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":579,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:29","scriptId":20675,"text":"“你们等等！犬次郎跑了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-PROLOGUE:20675:30","scriptId":20675,"text":"“什么！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:1","scriptId":20676,"text":"在运输车附近，能看到一只长得像大号秤砣的东西，正在贴地飞奔。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:2","scriptId":20676,"text":"扎眼的橘黄色还是很容易分辨的——是犬次郎","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:3","scriptId":20676,"text":"“还真是犬次郎，这家伙怎么在这里就开始乱跑了？抓住它。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":748,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:4","scriptId":20676,"text":"“好的！……诶？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":748,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:5","scriptId":20676,"text":"不过佐伊话音刚落，犬次郎就被抓住了——是维卡。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":748,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:6","scriptId":20676,"text":"只见维卡一脚将犬次郎牢牢踩住，然后弯腰将它提了起来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":748,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:7","scriptId":20676,"text":"“抓住了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:8","scriptId":20676,"text":"原来维卡并没离开运输车太远，所以她的位置正巧可以拦住犬次郎。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:9","scriptId":20676,"text":"维卡将犬次郎抱了过来，但犬次郎的四条机械腿还在前后律动就像是在挣扎。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:10","scriptId":20676,"text":"“这玩意怎么了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:11","scriptId":20676,"text":"“可能是不小心启动搜索模式？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:12","scriptId":20676,"text":"“不，犬次郎应该一直启动着搜索模式，我们没有手动关闭过。难道目标已经进入它的搜寻范围了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:13","scriptId":20676,"text":"“要不放了犬次郎我们跟着它，看看到底是什么情况？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":584,"right":578,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:14","scriptId":20676,"text":"“说得也是，维卡，放了犬次郎吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:15","scriptId":20676,"text":"“哦。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:16","scriptId":20676,"text":"维卡一松手犬次郎又开始跑了起来……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:17","scriptId":20676,"text":"“跟上去。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"917001-EPILOGUE:20676:18","scriptId":20676,"text":"“是。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
